<title>ZIMBABWE: SOCCER-DYNAMOS BEAT JOMO COSMOS IN AFRICA CUP WINNERS' CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DYNAMOS BEAT JOMO COSMOS IN AFRICA CUP WINNERS' CUP.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dynamos FC of Zimbabwe beat South Africa's Jomo Cosmos 2-1 (halftime 2-1) in an Africa Cup Winners' Cup second round, first leg match on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Dynamos - Lloyd Mutasa 15, Tauya Murewa 28.</p>
<p>Jomo Cosmos - Hilton Jordan 2</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
